      "math_academy_id": "e-5013",
      "problem": "Consider the picture shown below. Find the exact value of $|\\mathbf{a}|.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14251309/assets/140b4f8ced622eaf505d97c0f4d9c029365536927ea0c3e38e76904cba84ace2.png)",
      "worked_solution": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14251309/assets/1fc7b5efcaa81dd1a3416757c976e5d17b96f5040069b5eeeb941b1f7c149c34.png)\n\nIn $\\bigtriangleup AHB$ we have $\\angle AHB = 90^\\circ$, $AH=35\\:\\textrm{mm}$ and $BH=25\\:\\textrm{mm}.$ So, the Pythagorean theorem gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =\\sqrt{A{H}^{2}+B{H}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{35}^{2}+{25}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{1\\,850} \\\\  & =5\\sqrt{74}\\,\\text{mm}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
